1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,130
You were chasing a Koenigsegg,

2
00:00:01,130 --> 00:00:02,309
but you couldn't afford it.

3
00:00:02,309 --> 00:00:03,489
You were chasing a Pagani,

4
00:00:03,489 --> 00:00:04,669
but you couldn't afford it.

5
00:00:04,669 --> 00:00:05,807
You were chasing a yacht,

6
00:00:05,807 --> 00:00:06,987
but you couldn't afford it.

7
00:00:06,987 --> 00:00:08,208
You were chasing a mansion,

8
00:00:08,208 --> 00:00:09,388
but you couldn't afford it.

9
00:00:09,388 --> 00:00:10,443
And the only thing you

10
00:00:10,443 --> 00:00:12,020
managed to catch was the

11
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,190
sick antelope.

12
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:14,560
You caught a BMW.

13
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:15,778
And you tell everyone:

14
00:00:15,778 --> 00:00:17,124
I've always wanted a BMW.

15
00:00:17,124 --> 00:00:17,936
I like my BMW.

16
00:00:17,936 --> 00:00:18,627
Sure.

17
00:00:18,627 --> 00:00:19,757
But if you had enough

18
00:00:19,757 --> 00:00:21,385
to attract every single car

19
00:00:21,385 --> 00:00:22,651
into your car park,

20
00:00:22,651 --> 00:00:23,630
You wouldn't choose a BMW.

21
00:00:23,630 --> 00:00:24,502
And it's the same with

22
00:00:24,502 --> 00:00:25,520
the woman you're with.

23
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:26,457
You don't want her,

24
00:00:26,457 --> 00:00:27,581
you want someone else.

25
00:00:27,581 --> 00:00:28,729
She's the only one you

26
00:00:28,729 --> 00:00:29,339
could catch.

27
00:00:29,339 --> 00:00:31,345
You're living a life which

28
00:00:31,345 --> 00:00:32,475
is a fraction of what

29
00:00:32,475 --> 00:00:34,045
it should be because you're

30
00:00:34,045 --> 00:00:36,514
chasing as opposed to attracting.

31
00:00:36,514 --> 00:00:38,977
You can't chase two rabbits,

32
00:00:38,977 --> 00:00:41,111
you can only chase one.

33
00:00:41,111 --> 00:00:42,036
And that is the thing

34
00:00:42,036 --> 00:00:43,226
that is so destructive about

35
00:00:43,226 --> 00:00:44,300
chasing in general.
